    {
      "id": "2109877500700455161",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-13T05:22:50.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-13 13:22:50",
      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "A kid in a village school in India studies from the same textbook as a kid in Mumbai. \n\nWhat they don't get is the internet. \n\nAbout one in three Indian schools still has none, by the government's own count.\n\nJio now wants its own satellite network for 600,000 villages, reportedly done around 2035. \n\nThose kids will have finished school by then.\n\nStarlink could serve them this year. Let it switch on.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {},
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2109877500700455161",
      "images": [],
      "media": [],
      "enriched": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2109875497316298977",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-13T05:14:52.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-13 13:14:52",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "When Starlink helped save five lives at sea.\n\nA boat called Magic Bus was sinking in a storm, far off the coast of North Carolina.\n\nThe captain tried to call for help using the boat’s radio, but couldn’t reach anyone. He then used @Starlink Mini to connect his phone and call the U.S. Coast Guard.\n\nThe five people left the sinking boat in a liferaft. Rescuers arrived by helicopter and brought everyone back safely. Starlink helped them reach help when their lives were in danger.\n\nThis life-saving technology should be available in every part of the world.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "cb_doge",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498070100393754625/C2V-fbll_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-13 13:11:49",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-13T05:11:49.000Z",
        "id": "2109874730325160288",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2109874573135208448/img/GwOnlsYRe0s6HcKe.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 67.5,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2109874573135208448/img/GwOnlsYRe0s6HcKe.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2109874573135208448/vid/avc1/1920x1080/Zs4Qk7teboDsaWHh.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "When Starlink helped save five lives at sea.\n\nA boat called Magic Bus was sinking in a storm, far off the coast of North Carolina.\n\nThe captain tried to call for help using the boat’s radio, but couldn’t reach anyone. He then used @Starlink Mini to connect his phone and call the U.S. Coast Guard.\n\nThe five people left the sinking boat in a liferaft. Rescuers arrived by helicopter and brought everyone back safely. Starlink helped them reach help when their lives were in danger.\n\nThis life-saving technology should be available in every part of the world.",
        "url": "https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2109874730325160288",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
