      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "I think I have experienced “AGI”…\n\nJust did a 30-minute “phone call” with @bot. Together we got back to about 20 emails, organised my calendar for the week, wrote a proposal for my team, ordered lunch for my family, booked (and paid for) a hotel, and arranged a cab to the airport. It also gave me some great advice along the way. \n\nDid it all 100% “hands free” with my baby fast asleep on my chest. \n\nIf this is what life is like with superintelligence, I am all in.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
